SUMMARY:Derived Algebraic Geometry\, CoHAs and Operads
DESCRIPTION:We want to emphasize the use of derived algebraic geometry and operads as tools to make significant progress in two directions: geometric representation theory\, and specifically with the aim of constructing and studying cohomological Hall algebras \; topological field theories\, via the use of mapping stacks and Simpson shapes. More details here .\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/15829/
