DTSTART:20260625T144500
DTEND:20260625T160000
SUMMARY:CFT and QFT from the Fuzzy Sphere
DESCRIPTION:We use the Fuzzy Sphere technology to extract new 3d Ising CFT data and examine its properties in light of expectations from ergodicity. In our analysis\, a microscopic construction of the special conformal generators plays an important role. We also study 3d Ising Field Theory\, namely\, the Ising CFT deformed by a relevant operator. Here we use both the Fuzzy Sphere directly\, as well as Hamiltonian\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16865/
